4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=B697mFz1yMoQ7kNvwE1EFEH&_nc_oc=AdroTKjves-Z7Hlp60Lop5su51iOjvSCs4X77sgNihCTgqgmFDSY_t_Dp58ar1jbSAo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQD-e-5hUdYsijhxh_IfqeCoeAZeoHCxICxUOsO4yXP9Ng&oe=6A5390D4"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KG-MJTrANvoQ7kNvwEGIf3c&_nc_oc=AdqkKED4O6einNpOOFStgOjQRKpebWpyK1BSZdnUZyMUw6mG-gbpWaQ7Lqu_wd1LG5k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCU0Ajobwv9YJWxjy7ED1_UdoY6EZb4plfCEPDxpL-1Kg&oe=6A5395B2"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KhckJ6dn5mwQ7kNvwGRPVtb&_nc_oc=AdqgWAqmjtDQMU-wFQbunPFbDhamXyUY8CvhKC1DNk87Jc2VVAgaC6eOmmGGP7CUcXw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCbER8Avb-OMnTqipkGwlC69E8d5OSul35Ou3w8p-HqQA&oe=6A53A355"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p